    "title": {
      "en": "Mislaid Curiosities Allow Massive Stat Buff Stacking in Labyrinths",
      "es": "Curiosidades extraviadas permiten el apilamiento masivo de búfares de estadísticas en laberintos"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Mislaid Curiosities Allow Massive Stat Buff Stacking in Labyrinths...",
      "es": "Curiosidades extraviadas permiten el apilamiento masivo de búfares de estadísticas en laberintos..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0fca6cefd39.43581509\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">When making your way through the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan, make sure to loot Mislaid Curiosities to stack up some massive stat buffs!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_cape_armor_troll_d_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves-season-journey-best-builds-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Season 2 Delves Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_10_blacksmithing_consumable_key_color1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><h2 id=\"mislaid-curiosities\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Mislaid Curiosities</span></h2>Mislaid Curiosities are scattered in Midnight Delves, granting Valeera experience and temporary stat buffs. These buffs last for the remainder of the Delve, which isn't very long for a normal Delve. However, for the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan, these stat buffs last for the <b>entire run</b>, meaning you can stack these stat buffs up massively and use them to your advantage against the Nemesis boss, Kindo'jan.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305627.jpg\" id=\"1305627\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305627.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Stat Buffs\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.901141 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>You can get eight different buffs from Mislaid Curiosities. Each one you loot will increase one or two stats:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Maximum Health</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Movement Speed</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Primary Stat</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Haste</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Critical Strike</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Mastery</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Versatility</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Damage Reduction</div></li></ul>By the time you reach Kindo'jan, you can stack up a lot of bonus stats and become super powerful. This can trivialize Kindo'jan and help you kill him very quickly, maybe even before he enters Phase 2. The bonus movement speed also helps you dodge some of his mechanics more easily, such as the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1300374/de-rising-storm\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_necro_chillofdeath.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">De Rising Storm</span></a> ability.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>When making your way through the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan, make sure to loot Mislaid Curiosities to stack up some massive stat buffs!<br /><br />Labyrinth of Kindo'janSeason 2 Delves Guide<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Mislaid Curiosities</h2><br /><br />Mislaid Curiosities are scattered in Midnight Delves, granting Valeera experience and temporary stat buffs. These buffs last for the remainder of the Delve, which isn't very long for a normal Delve. However, for the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan, these stat buffs last for the <b>entire run</b>, meaning you can stack these stat buffs up massively and use them to your advantage against the Nemesis boss, Kindo'jan.<br /><br />You can get eight different buffs from Mislaid Curiosities. Each one you loot will increase one or two stats:<br /><ul><li>Maximum Health</li><li>Movement Speed</li><li>Primary Stat</li><li>Haste</li><li>Critical Strike</li><li>Mastery</li><li>Versatility</li><li>Damage Reduction</li></ul><br /><br />By the time you reach Kindo'jan, you can stack up a lot of bonus stats and become super powerful. This can trivialize Kindo'jan and help you kill him very quickly, maybe even before he enters Phase 2. The bonus movement speed also helps you dodge some of his mechanics more easily, such as the <a href=\"/spell=1300374/de-rising-storm\">De Rising Storm</a> ability.</noscript>            \n        ",
