    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0fcc6555d48.36028625\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes many Labyrinth bug fixes!<br><br>Many players had issues with Labyrinth runs<a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/multiple-bugs-preventing-progress-in-labyrinths-forcing-383409\" data-contiguous=\"true\"> ending up in an uncompletable state</a>. This has now been fixed according to the hotfixes.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2382684/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"hotfixes\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><hr><b>October 14, 2026</b><br><br><b>Aqir Invasions</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where the final boss of the invasion was not properly randomizing between the three different types.</div></li></ul><b>Classes</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Druid</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Guardian</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue causing Rebirth in Bear Form to have an incorrect mana cost.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue preventing the Bear Form version of Heart of the Wild from being cast.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue causing Persistence to grant an incorrect amount of armor.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Restoration</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where Nature’s Bounty could cause Abundance to fall off the Druid early.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Delves</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Dundun has returned and hides within Bountiful delves once again. May you revel in his radiant prosperity!</div></li></ul><b>Labyrinth</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where the kill credit for a boss may not register if it was the second time the boss had to be defeated in the same Labyrinth run.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where the Kindo’jan encounter would fail to successfully complete when Kindo’jan reached 1 health.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue in the “Returning the Bounty” scenario that could sometimes prevent the initial bag interaction from being completable.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue in the “Returning the Bounty” scenario where Hording Looters could sometimes stop spawning.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where Ancient Hash’ey Battle Arts enchantment effects can trigger outside of delves and The Labyrinth of Kindo’jan.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Increased the maximum item level for the Ancient Hash’ey Battle Art enchantment to 344 (was 334).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Players can no longer cleanse Cursed Energy in the “Fools and Curses” scenario.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Enemies in Halazzi’s Lair no longer spawn within the walls.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Characters can no longer fall through the terrain when respawning in Nalorakk’s Rest.</div></li></ul><b>Quests</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Ancient Foes in the Vaults of Atal’Utek will now properly reward Primordial Venom Motes to players who defeat them while in raid groups.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed issue where NPCs in Amani’Zar Village weren’t visible during the quest “De Legend of de Hash’ey”.</div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes many Labyrinth bug fixes!<br /><br />Many players had issues with Labyrinth runs<a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/multiple-bugs-preventing-progress-in-labyrinths-forcing-383409\"> ending up in an uncompletable state</a>. This has now been fixed according to the hotfixes. <br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><br /><b>October 14, 2026</b><br /><br /><b>Aqir Invasions</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Fixed an issue where the final boss of the invasion was not properly randomizing between the three different types.</li></ul><br /><b>Classes</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Druid</b><br /><br /> <b>Guardian</b><br /><br /> Fixed an issue causing Rebirth in Bear Form to have an incorrect mana cost.</li><li>Fixed an issue preventing the Bear Form version of Heart of the Wild from being cast.</li><li>Fixed an issue causing Persistence to grant an incorrect amount of armor.</li></ul><br /> <b>Restoration</b><br /> <ul><li>Fixed an issue where Nature’s Bounty could cause Abundance to fall off the Druid early.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Delves</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Dundun has returned and hides within Bountiful delves once again. May you revel in his radiant prosperity!</li></ul><br /><b>Labyrinth</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Fixed an issue where the kill credit for a boss may not register if it was the second time the boss had to be defeated in the same Labyrinth run.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Kindo’jan encounter would fail to successfully complete when Kindo’jan reached 1 health.</li><li>Fixed an issue in the “Returning the Bounty” scenario that could sometimes prevent the initial bag interaction from being completable.</li><li>Fixed an issue in the “Returning the Bounty” scenario where Hording Looters could sometimes stop spawning.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Ancient Hash’ey Battle Arts enchantment effects can trigger outside of delves and The Labyrinth of Kindo’jan.</li><li>Increased the maximum item level for the Ancient Hash’ey Battle Art enchantment to 344 (was 334).</li><li>Players can no longer cleanse Cursed Energy in the “Fools and Curses” scenario.</li><li>Enemies in Halazzi’s Lair no longer spawn within the walls.</li><li>Characters can no longer fall through the terrain when respawning in Nalorakk’s Rest.</li></ul><br /><b>Quests</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Ancient Foes in the Vaults of Atal’Utek will now properly reward Primordial Venom Motes to players who defeat them while in raid groups.</li><li>Fixed issue where NPCs in Amani’Zar Village weren’t visible during the quest “De Legend of de Hash’ey”.</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
